<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?> <?xml-stylesheet type="text/xsl" href="rss.xsl"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"> <channel> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title><description>SONiC NOS（sonic-net/SONiC）の日本語非公式ドキュメント</description><link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link><atom:link href="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /> <docs>https://github.com/aoki-taquan/sonic-unofficial-docs</docs><language>ja</language> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:59:31 -0000</pubDate> <lastBuildDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:59:31 -0000</lastBuildDate> <ttl>1440</ttl> <generator>MkDocs RSS plugin - v1.19.0</generator> <image> <url>None</url> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link> </image> <item> <title>DPU / ENI / VDPU / REMOTE_DPU テーブル</title> <description>CONFIG_DB の DPU・ENI・VDPU・REMOTE_DPU テーブル — SmartSwitch の DPU (Data Processing Unit) と ENI (Elastic Network Interface) の転送情報を定義し、DashEniFwdOrch が ACL ルールへ変換する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/dpu-eni/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:57:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/dpu-eni/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/dpu-eni.png" type="image/png" length="43054" /> </item> <item> <title>DPU_STATE フィールド詳細 (CHASSIS_STATE_DB) — デフォルト・更新条件</title> <description>CHASSIS_STATE_DB の DPU_STATE テーブル各フィールドのコード由来デフォルト・fallback・更新タイミングを chassisd ソースから精査した詳細リファレンス。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/dpu-state-detail/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:57:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/dpu-state-detail/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/dpu-state-detail.png" type="image/png" length="38423" /> </item> <item> <title>MUX_CABLE_TABLE / HW_MUX_CABLE_TABLE (STATE_DB)</title> <description>STATE_DB の MUX_CABLE_TABLE と HW_MUX_CABLE_TABLE — linkmgrd / orchagent / ycabled が書き込む Dual-ToR mux cable 実行時状態テーブル。コード由来のデフォルト値と乖離を整理する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/mux-cable-state/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:57:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/mux-cable-state/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/mux-cable-state.png" type="image/png" length="34742" /> </item> <item> <title>STP / ICCP 連携 — コード由来デフォルト詳細</title> <description>MCLAG 環境における STP と ICCP (iccpd) の連携メカニズム、STP ロール決定アルゴリズム、CONFIG_DB フィールドとの対応、および TLV_T_MLACP_STP_INFO 未サポート状況を詳細解説。Phase A + Phase B + Phase C + Phase D + Phase E + Phase F + Phase G + Phase H 分析。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/stp-iccp/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:57:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/stp-iccp/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/stp-iccp.png" type="image/png" length="34721" /> </item> <item> <title>APPL_DB STP Orchagent テーブル — フィールドとコード由来デフォルト</title> <description>SONiC orchagent が購読する APPL_DB の STP 関連 4 テーブル (STP_VLAN_INSTANCE_TABLE / STP_PORT_STATE_TABLE / STP_FASTAGEING_FLUSH_TABLE / STP_INST_PORT_FLUSH_TABLE) のフィールド定義・暗黙デフォルト・SAI マッピング・書込み順依存・暗黙参照テーブル・ハードコード定数・副作用・Redis 通知メカニズム・プラットフォーム差分を詳解。Phase A+B+C+D+E+F+G+H 分析。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/stp-orch/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:57:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/stp-orch/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/stp-orch.png" type="image/png" length="44207" /> </item> <item> <title>STP / STP_VLAN / STP_PORT テーブル — 暗黙デフォルト詳細</title> <description>CONFIG_DB の STP (グローバル)・STP_VLAN・STP_PORT・STP_VLAN_PORT テーブルの各フィールドのコード由来デフォルト値・ハードコード挙動・モード別差異を詳細解説。PVST / MSTP Phase A–C 分析（暗黙参照テーブル含む）。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/stp/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:57:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/stp/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/stp.png" type="image/png" length="41527" /> </item> <item> <title>VNET_ROUTE / VNET_ROUTE_TUNNEL テーブル</title> <description>VNET_ROUTE / VNET_ROUTE_TUNNEL テーブル — VXLAN overlay 上の仮想ネットワーク内静的経路を CONFIG_DB に定義するテーブル群。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/vnet-route/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:57:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/vnet-route/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/vnet-route.png" type="image/png" length="36804" /> </item> <item> <title>APPL_DB VRF_TABLE (VRFOrch)</title> <description>APPL_DB VRF_TABLE — vrfmgrd が CONFIG_DB VRF テーブルを転写し VRFOrch が SAI Virtual Router を生成するパイプライン。フィールドのコード由来デフォルトと orchagent 内部挙動を記述する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/vrf-orch/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:57:28 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/vrf-orch/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/vrf-orch.png" type="image/png" length="43785" /> </item> <item> <title>STATE_DB COPP 状態テーブル</title> <description>STATE_DB の COPP_GROUP_TABLE / COPP_TRAP_TABLE / COPP_TRAP_CAPABILITY_TABLE — CoPP グループ・トラップの適用状態と SAI 能力情報。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/copp-state/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:57:23 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/copp-state/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/copp-state.png" type="image/png" length="34154" /> </item> <item> <title>PORT_STORM_CONTROL テーブル — 暗黙デフォルト詳細</title> <description>PORT_STORM_CONTROL テーブルの暗黙デフォルト・ハードコード挙動・YANG と実装の乖離を詳細解説。BUM (broadcast / unknown-unicast / unknown-multicast) storm control の Phase A 分析。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/storm-control/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:57:23 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/storm-control/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/storm-control.png" type="image/png" length="37003" /> </item> <item> <title>STP_MST_INST / STP_MST_PORT テーブル</title> <description>CONFIG_DB の STP_MST_INST・STP_MST_PORT テーブルの各フィールドのコード由来デフォルト値・ハードコード挙動・MST 起動順序・失敗挙動・ハードコード定数・副次 DB 書込・discrepancy を詳細解説。Phase A+B+C+D+E+F 分析。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/stp-mst/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:57:23 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/stp-mst/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/stp-mst.png" type="image/png" length="35202" /> </item> <item> <title>DHCPV4_RELAY テーブル</title> <description>DHCPV4_RELAY テーブル — DHCPv4 relay agent の VLAN 単位設定を保持する。DEVICE_METADATA.has_sonic_dhcpv4_relay = true のとき sonic-dhcpv4-relay (新実装) が読み出し、relay agent を構成する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/dhcpv4-relay/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:29 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/dhcpv4-relay/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/dhcpv4-relay.png" type="image/png" length="36792" /> </item> <item> <title>NTP_KEY テーブル</title> <description>NTP_KEY テーブル — NTP 認証 (symmetric key) で使用する鍵を CONFIG_DB に蓄積するテーブル。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/ntp-key/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:29 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/ntp-key/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/ntp-key.png" type="image/png" length="24130" /> </item> <item> <title>AUTO_TECHSUPPORT テーブル</title> <description>AUTO_TECHSUPPORT テーブル — イベント駆動 (core dump 生成) で show techsupport を自動実行・古いダンプを掃除する機能の設定。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/auto-techsupport/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:19 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/auto-techsupport/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/auto-techsupport.png" type="image/png" length="34292" /> </item> <item> <title>STATE_DB BGP 関連テーブル</title> <description>STATE_DB / BMP_STATE_DB の BGP 関連テーブル（BGP_STATE_TABLE・BGP_PEER_CONFIGURED_TABLE・BGP_NEIGHBOR_TABLE・BGP_RIB_IN_TABLE・BGP_RIB_OUT_TABLE）のスキーマ・フィールドデフォルト・書き込みタイミングを解説する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/state-bgp/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:19 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/state-bgp/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/state-bgp.png" type="image/png" length="32519" /> </item> <item> <title>SYSLOG_CONFIG_FEATURE テーブル</title> <description>SYSLOG_CONFIG_FEATURE テーブル — SYSLOG_CONFIG.GLOBAL の rate-limit を FEATURE (docker) ごとに上書きするテーブル。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/syslog-config-feature/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:19 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/syslog-config-feature/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/syslog-config-feature.png" type="image/png" length="34832" /> </item> <item> <title>LLDP / LLDP_PORT テーブル</title> <description>LLDP / LLDP_PORT テーブル — LLDP テーブルはシステム全体の LLDP 設定 (GLOBAL キー) を、LLDP_PORT テーブルはポート単位の LLDP 有効化 / モードを保持する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/lldp/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:13 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/lldp/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/lldp.png" type="image/png" length="28056" /> </item> <item> <title>PBH_TABLE / PBH_RULE テーブル</title> <description>PBH_TABLE / PBH_RULE テーブル — Policy Based Hashing (PBH) は、packet match 条件ごとに ECMP / LAG hash profile を切り替えるための CONFIG_DB テーブル群。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/pbh/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:13 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/pbh/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/pbh.png" type="image/png" length="37767" /> </item> <item> <title>VLAN_INTERFACE テーブル</title> <description>VLAN_INTERFACE テーブル — VLAN を L3 IF (SVI) として扱う設定を保持する。VRF / VNET binding、IP アサイン、NAT zone、MPLS、IPv6 link-local、grat ARP / proxy ARP、loopback action、MAC を持つ。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/vlan-interface/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:13 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/vlan-interface/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/vlan-interface.png" type="image/png" length="34976" /> </item> <item> <title>APPL_DB ACL テーブル群</title> <description>APPL_DB の ACL_TABLE_TABLE / ACL_TABLE_TYPE_TABLE / ACL_RULE_TABLE — vnetorch・mclagsyncd・dashenifwdorch が直接書き込む APPL_DB 側 ACL エントリの構造・フィールドデフォルト・コード挙動。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/appl-acl/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:08 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/appl-acl/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/appl-acl.png" type="image/png" length="31058" /> </item> </channel> </rss>